reportToEmin.md
reportToEmin.pdf

# Ephemeral report-generator scripts and outputs (personal; not deliverables)
generate_report_pdf.py
gen_week1_pdf.py
update_week1.md
update_week1.pdf
sweep_report.md

# Policy note: parity_design.pdf and parity_usage.pdf ARE intentionally committed.
